ifications without re-targeting.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-24\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Canvas Feature\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor 3.1 added interactive canvas feature for visual dashboards and custom interfaces with tables, boxes, diagrams, charts, plus existing components like diff views and todo lists. Canvases persist in the agent window sidebar.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-15\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]"
